## Task 1: Basic cost and resource allocation

- chargeset dev 100% (100% of cost)
- chargeset dev 70/30 (70% cost, 30% resource)
- chargeset dev 50/50 (50% cost, 50% resource)
- chargeset dev 0 (0% cost, 100% resource)
- chargeset dev 100 (100% cost)

