## Summary

This file provides 5 different variations of the mwe004/tutorial.tjp for testing different charge/credit configurations and resource allocations.

Each variation tests different scenarios:
- Basic cost/resource allocation
- Credit manual
- Aggregate tasks vs resources
- Balance cost revenue
- Resource rate variations

The golden test script will parse this file and generate test cases for each variation.

